{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act46side_level_act46side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act46side",
  "stageId": "act46side_04",
  "title": "并蒂生",
  "storyCode": "OS-4",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act46side/level_act46side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1440ee44fb969ab41c0e219f14a9435dc4097148ee95b0d007b2ce1c53dd9d4e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "古罗，头上纱布还没揭，怎么就回来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "总是这么鲁莽，说了多少遍了，行动之前要三思！你现在就给我回去医院好好躺着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷......我是听说您要应布朗陶家的约去和菈塔托丝谈判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷，您千万不能去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "怎么，我还怕她不成？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "菈塔托丝那个毒女人说要跟我挑明真相，我倒要看看她嘴巴里能吐出什么货色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "可是老爷......布朗陶把约见的地方选在了自家领地，明摆着就是有阴谋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哼，你以为我什么都不知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "就算她真敢动手，我佩尔罗契家何时忌惮过任何一场战斗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "就算是她的地盘，我佩尔罗契家就无计可施？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "倒是你小子，不来倒好，来了，我看到你的那个头就来气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷生气我也得劝老爷！我就坐在门口，不走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "跟你有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "属下没本事，自己伤成这副模样，没办法保护老爷，只能让老爷别去冒险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哎......！我说的生气不是生你的气，是布朗陶那帮杂碎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "放心，古罗，我这就帮你去找他们算账。我会让他们知道，没人能欺负到佩尔罗契家头上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "古罗，是我佩尔罗契家的兄弟，你就让开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古罗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "text": "老爷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "来人，送古罗将军回房间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几个士兵搀扶着古罗，把他扶回了房间里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "不怕归不怕，还是要做好准备，得多带点人过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "*谢拉格俚语*，儿郎们，多备几辆车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "休露丝夫人，晚餐已经准备好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "大夫人呢？不一起吃饭吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "菈塔托丝夫人刚刚离家了，让二位不要过分担心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_263_1",
      "text": "我记得大夫人说过今天要和佩尔罗契家谈判，可是这个时间也太早了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_263_1",
      "text": "她是自己一个人去的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "我们不清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "......尤卡坦，我总觉得不对劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "你去找她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_263_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "休露丝夫人，尤卡坦老爷，请等一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_262_1",
      "text": "又怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "大夫人离开家以前，给我留下最后的命令是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "今天晚上，绝对不可以让二位离开家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶管家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_270_1",
      "text": "不管用什么办法......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_263_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "圣女大人！趴下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "该死......这些到底是什么人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "在谢拉格的土地上，竟然想谋害圣女？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "也许不是谢拉格人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "他们很危险......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "放心圣女大人！我拼了命也会保护好你的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "他们想进来也没那么容易......瞧瞧谢拉格猎人的本事吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小猎手拿起重弩，熟练地拉弦搭箭，从破碎的窗户探出身去，几乎没有瞄准便扣动扳机。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "屋外立即传来几声惨叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......命中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "要当心......他们人还是很多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "不能一直被他们围困在这里，得想个办法，至少先逃出去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我们该怎么办——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "先别着急，听我指挥......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "袭击者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伏在雪地上的袭击者向后方作出示意潜伏的手势，前车之鉴使得他们更加谨慎。\n他们警戒着不知何时会从窗户中射出的精准的弩箭，一边缓缓缩小着包围圈。\n一道人影在窗帘后若隐若现，帘襟微微摆动着......\n袭击者举起了手中的弩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "毒矢射出，准确射中窗帘后的身影，屋里在传来一阵倒地的声响后就再也没有了动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "袭击者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "text": "已命中，待确认。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "袭击者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "text": "二三四队保持阵型，一队跟我上前确认。谨慎靠近，线报说，还有一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "几人摸近小屋门前，确认过屋内的确没有任何声响后才破门而入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "袭击者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "text": "这......这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "袭击者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_284_1",
      "text": "......木雕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一尊耶拉冈德的塑像倒在地上，那支箭正插在雕像的脑袋上。\n入侵者没有注意到，在他们闯入房间的同时，细微的机械传动声响起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "浑厚的铃声响起，他们顿时觉得手脚失去力气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接着，五张拉满的弩具，一张巨大的网，统统瞄准了来犯的入侵者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "哈！如圣女大人所料，果然上钩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "破坏耶拉冈德的雕像可是重罪，你们就好好悔过吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "就是现在！跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A组，汇报情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“A组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "佩尔罗契车队已越过第三观察哨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“A组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "确认目标位置——前进方向第一辆车，后座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“A组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是否开始行动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "批准行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“A组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，情况有变！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“A组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "目标停止移动了，视线受阻，我看不到目前的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“A组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......布朗陶家的卫兵？为什么会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......停止行动，我正在接通一号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "你家主子叫我们来谈判，又派你们在这里拦着我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_286_1",
      "text": "阿克托斯大人，前面就是约定的谈判地点了，请您留步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_286_1",
      "text": "为了安全起见，请让我们检查你们的载具。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "可笑，地点都是你们选的，还怕我们这几个人。你们布朗陶家的人还真是胆量和心眼一样小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_286_1",
      "text": "这是菈塔托丝夫人的指令，请阿克托斯大人配合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "好，我阿克托斯身正不怕影歪，这几辆车随你们怎么查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_286_1",
      "text": "没什么问题了，阿克托斯大人，可以通行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "慢着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "你们查完了，也该让我查查你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "兄弟们，从这里到布朗陶家宅子的路上，还有周围，都给我仔细地搜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "发现不对劲的人，直接给我逮过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩尔罗契家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_285_1",
      "text": "是！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A组，继续汇报目标位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A组，听到回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "A组，听得到吗？汇报情况！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么回事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“C组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "报告指挥处，目标车辆已进入我方监控区域。正在靠近最终行动点，是否行动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他是什么时候过去的......目标有任何动作吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“C组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，目标没有下车。我的角度看不到车内的情况。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "先不要轻易行动，等到确认目标位置再动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“B组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "报告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“B组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我方观测位置附近发现疑似谢拉格武装的人员，他们正在巡逻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能确认身份吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“B组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "无法确定，也许是佩尔罗契家的守卫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“C组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "报告！我方周围同样发现谢拉格人，他们正在排查附近的每一栋建筑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“C组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们的位置可能已经暴露，是否提前行动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不可以，继续待命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“B组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "报告，我方位置暴露了！已经开始交战！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“C组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "敌方发现我们了！我方无法维持隐藏，我们无法维持隐藏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“C组”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "请求最终行动许可！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "该死的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚间谍",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "行动——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "北风凉......山路长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......狡猾牙兽岩缝藏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "举起弩，心儿晃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......想起家里小木窗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "树林是猎人的主场。\n小猎手带着恩雅跑进了林中，不知从何而来的袭击者依然穷追不舍。\n但是很快，神出鬼没的弩箭就让他们接二连三地在这片危险的树林中殒命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "至少还有一人......在哪里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "小猎手知道，刚才射出的那一箭已经让自己暴露了位置，敌人反而遁入阴影中。\n她躲在一棵粗壮的树后，再次用耳朵锁定到了那一丝响动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉弦，搭箭，扣动扳机——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......偏了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "射空的一瞬间，小猎手被身后的人扑倒在地。\n袭击者捡起了散落在地上的弩箭，对准小猎手的喉咙。\n他的手还没有来得及挥下，就被迅速冻结。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一道模糊的身影转瞬间来到袭击者上方，以千钧之势劈下一击。\n土地震颤着，树木上的积雪四散崩飞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "......锏？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凌厉的箭锋射向锏，却被锏单手抓住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......你是什么人？想对圣女做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "茱安娜住手！这位是锏小姐，我们的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "锏......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "茱安娜迟疑地撤下搭上的箭，打量着锏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我听说过你的名字......知道你很厉害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "但我还是第一次看到......人能被嵌进冻土里去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "锏......你为什么会在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "是恩希欧迪斯让我来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "抱歉圣女大人，但这个时候也顾不上什么规矩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "他怎么知道我会遭遇危险......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "这不是最近在谢拉格发生的唯一袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "就在您离开蔓珠院后不久，希瓦艾什和佩尔罗契家的人分别遭遇了袭击。现在三大家恐怕又快要打得不可开交了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "怎么会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "这些人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三人这才有工夫仔细察看这些袭击者——如今已经是横七竖八地倒在地上的尸体。\n这些人都穿着佩尔罗契家的战甲，手中的武器也毫无疑问是谢拉格的制式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "佩尔罗契家的人......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你不要胡说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "佩尔罗契家的人从来都是最忠诚的，怎么可能做出谋害圣女的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "那眼前的这些人，总该有个解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "当......当然是伪装的！怎么想都是有人要故意栽赃才对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "我倒要仔细看看......这些人伪装成佩尔罗契的战士，一定会露出破绽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "对了！你看这弩箭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "哼......这些人自以为搞来一套佩尔罗契家的衣服就能伪装得天衣无缝了。但他们弄错了很重要的一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "你看，这些人携带的箭都是双羽箭，但是佩尔罗契的战士用的都是三羽箭，后者原本更适用于战场，而非打猎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "父亲和我说过，我们家还没从佩尔罗契里分出来的时候，是最忠诚、最精锐的战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "祖传的这套射击的本事，最早都是祖先们打仗锻炼来的，尤其是对付——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......对付希瓦艾什。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "倒是很合理的解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "......多年前的旧事罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "佩尔罗契、布朗陶、希瓦艾什......三族之间早已结束了战争，你们也因耶拉冈德仁慈的指引从而选择成为猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "嗯......耶拉冈德在上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "那究竟是谁在伪装佩尔罗契家的人，应该也不难猜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "维多利亚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "锏拔下插在维多利亚人咽喉处的弩箭，来回打量了一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "这支箭是你自己制作的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "没错，我父亲从小就教我制造箭矢了，用的是我们家祖传的手艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "祖传？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "箭尾簇羽的剪法，箭头打磨的形状，甚至箭身的刻痕，都是乌萨斯人特有的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "怎么可能？父亲和我说这是耶拉冈德信徒的记号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "我在卡西米尔竞技场里不止一次见过类似的箭，用它的人各个自称掌握最传统的乌萨斯战技。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "虽然大多是为了商业炒作，但联合会赞助的历史学家们确实有真实史料，我看过完整的考据材料以及出土文物，不会有错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "可，我们都是谢拉格本地人啊？曾经和佩尔罗契是一家呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "乌萨斯是乌萨斯，谢拉格是谢拉格，他们和我们怎么会有什么关系......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......恩雅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“......有人带着旌旗，有人带着号鼓，有人带着刀兵。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“外来三人在各处争斗，血染河川，为祂所不忍。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“祂走向会战之地，宣讲道——”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“你们若收敛锋芒、归一同心，必有丰沛之福，可蒙我的荫庇。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“三人愚钝不化，竟在祂的宣讲后仍起歹心、兵戎相见。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“祂只得开天裂云，降下神迹，以停止兵戈。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“其中一人哭泣：血海深仇，何以能忘？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "“祂也为之流泪，祂的泪水冻结了敌人，化为三座永恒的雪峰。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "这是......在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "《耶拉冈德》经文中常被忽视的一段......我想，现在终于能解释清楚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "茱安娜，也许你们家......应该说整个佩尔罗契家确实都源自古乌萨斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茱安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_4211_snhunt_1",
      "text": "......你也这么觉得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "嗯，但不止是你们，希瓦艾什与布朗陶同样不是谢拉格本地人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "正如经文所说，我们三家都是外来者，在远古时为了争夺资源而血战不休，直到耶拉冈德出手干预。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "而三座雪山，直观上似乎是围绕谢拉格的三座山峰，事实上则是祂为我们划定的三家族领地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“若不息刀剑，祂仍会再临”......\n几年前也正是祂显圣于我，才平息了三族数百年以来最接近分崩离析的一次矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "所以三家必须“归一同心”，才可蒙祂的荫庇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2010_1",
      "text": "耶拉冈德教给我们的第一条美德......便是宽恕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩尔罗契家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_285_1",
      "text": "老爷！我们抓住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高大的护卫将几个五花大绑的人推了上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩尔罗契家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_285_1",
      "text": "就是这几个家伙，躲在街边的空房子里，鬼鬼祟祟的，身上还带着望远镜和奇怪的通讯设备，看上去是维多利亚人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "呵......还真是和我想的一点不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "菈塔托丝是真的准备勾结维多利亚人要老子的命，我们就把这几个人带到她眼前去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "不，当着蔓珠院和三大家的面，看看她还有什么话好说！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "什么人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "阿克托斯大人，剩下几个维多利亚的探子我们都抓住了，您平安无事就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "什么......这是什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "菈塔托丝夫人交给我们的任务，是保护阿克托斯老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "在您来的路上我们就一直跟着您了，这几个人一早就准备对您下手，都被我们拦下来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "护卫说着，也将几个绑起来的间谍推到众人面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "这都是什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "......菈塔托丝现在在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布朗陶家护卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "text": "她说，她会想办法引开维多利亚埋伏在这的间谍，等到他们暴露的时候，我们就可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "古老的布朗陶宅邸彻底迸裂，如同纸盒被绞碎。\n玻璃混合着木头的碎屑四处飞溅，烈焰吞噬着历史与财富留下的痕迹，滚滚浓烟让夜晚的山风都显得炙热。\n佩尔罗契战士瞪大了双眼，棕色的轿车后被波及倒地的士兵们互相搀扶着爬起。\n爆炸的回声渐散，只剩下汽车鸣笛与燃烧的响声......\n一件烧焦的夹克飘零落地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "这是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "......菈塔托丝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "text": "你在搞什么鬼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
